00:23:30,180 --> 00:23:41,180
Then, because the line is folded in the position, it will cause the line to be a little broken and unstable, we need to adjust it

212
00:23:41,180 --> 00:23:46,180
In the 3D window, click the display inner line button to hide the inner line

213
00:23:46,180 --> 00:23:52,180
Then select the new line type again, adjust the diameter to prevent the line from being folded

214
00:23:52,180 --> 00:23:54,180
Now the line is displayed as a normal white line

215
00:23:54,180 --> 00:23:57,180
Then continue to adjust other values

216
00:24:02,180 --> 00:24:09,180
Use the positioning ball to adjust the position of the pull head so that it does not penetrate the plate

217
00:24:09,180 --> 00:24:22,180
Select the line segment line to add some lines to the edge of the pocket

218
00:24:22,180 --> 00:24:24,180
Click the copy button to copy a line type

219
00:24:24,180 --> 00:24:31,180
Select the edit line tool in the line tool group, select these new lines

220
00:24:31,180 --> 00:24:35,180
Click the apply button to apply the new line type to these lines

221
00:24:35,180 --> 00:24:46,180
According to the required effect, change the values ​​of the copied lines, such as diameter, length, color, etc.

222
00:24:46,180 --> 00:24:52,180
Select the pocket plate to gradually reduce their particle diameter from 20 to 5

223
00:24:54,180 --> 00:25:04,180
Select the camera to add some dog-shaped lines

224
00:25:04,180 --> 00:25:08,180
In the element editor window, slide to the bottom to open the physical elements values

225
00:25:08,180 --> 00:25:15,180
You can see this fabric's various physical elements

226
00:25:15,180 --> 00:25:20,180
We will increase some corner intensity values to create a thicker and stiffer effect

227
00:25:20,180 --> 00:25:22,180
Please pay attention when we use the magnifying glass

228
00:25:22,180 --> 00:25:29,420
Please note that when we use the hardening function, in fact, the bend strength of the version is as if it has been temporarily increased

229
00:25:29,420 --> 00:25:39,680
After improving the bend strength of the front and rear and the bend strength of the front and rear, and the simulation is stable, we can increase the bend strength in the direction of the two corner lines to 70

230
00:25:39,680 --> 00:25:44,980
Then you can increase the bend strength to a higher value according to your needs

231
00:25:44,980 --> 00:25:48,880
The bag production part is over, please look forward to our subsequent other videos

232
00:25:52,180 --> 00:25:56,460
